{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54358","headline":"三明大师赠彻大德 · 杜荀鹤","name":"三明大师赠彻大德","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"存诗勾引未能休，闲即因吟到御沟。\n故园别来杉桧老，旧山禅处水云秋。\n寒声渐细钟摇寺，夜色无穷月满楼。\n攀羡此情高且逸，平生辛苦未能醻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}